# 📚 TOEIC Vocabulary - Day20

| Word | Meaning | Example |
|---|---|---|
| recruit | 채용하다 | The company plans to recruit new employees. |
| resign | 사임하다, 퇴사하다 | He decided to resign from his position. |
| promote | 승진시키다, 홍보하다 | She was promoted to manager. |
| transfer | 이동시키다, 전근시키다 | He was transferred to another department. |
| retire | 은퇴하다 | The manager will retire next year. |

---

## Today's Mission

- [ ] Memorize all five words.
- [ ] Make one sentence using **recruit**.
- [ ] Make one sentence using **promote**.

